 "faq": [
  {
   "q": "Where is Coastal Edge?",
   "a": "Coastal Edge is at 401 Boulevard in Seaside Heights, New Jersey, one block from the beach and the boardwalk and a few blocks from Barnegat Bay."
  },
  {
   "q": "Is the building finished?",
   "a": "Yes. Construction is complete and residences are ready for move in. You can tour finished homes and the common areas."
  },
  {
   "q": "What sizes are the residences?",
   "a": "There are 36 residences on floors two through five. Layouts are two bedrooms plus a den or three bedrooms, from about 1,303 to 1,580 square feet inside, and every home has a private deck from about 69 to 346 square feet."
  },
  {
   "q": "Which residences are available and what do they cost?",
   "a": "The availability page shows the status of every residence. Prices are shown for the homes that are currently listed. For the others, send a request and the sales team will reply with current pricing."
  },
  {
   "q": "What amenities does the building have?",
   "a": "A heated indoor pool and sauna, a rooftop observation deck, a fitness center, a recreation room, a business center with a conference room, a pet wash station, a furnished lobby and an elevator."
  },
  {
   "q": "Is parking included?",
   "a": "Each residence comes with assigned covered parking in the building garage. The garage is compatible with electric vehicle charging. Ask the sales team about the space that goes with a specific residence."
  },
  {
   "q": "What are the monthly association fees?",
   "a": "Fees depend on the residence and are roughly $700 a month for the homes currently listed. The sales team can give you the exact figure and what it covers."
  },
  {
   "q": "Is there a property tax program?",
   "a": "The building is part of a long term tax abatement agreement with the Borough of Seaside Heights. Ask the sales team for the current figures for the residence you are looking at."
  },
  {
   "q": "Is there a warranty?",
   "a": "Yes. Residences are sold with a 10 year new home warranty."
  },
  {
   "q": "Can I rent out my residence?",
   "a": "Rentals are governed by the condominium association's rules and by Borough of Seaside Heights requirements. The sales team can send you the current rental policy."
  },
  {
   "q": "Are pets allowed?",
   "a": "The building has a pet wash station. Pet rules are set by the condominium association, so ask the sales team for the current policy."
  },
  {
   "q": "Can I tour the building?",
   "a": "Yes. Use the schedule a tour form and the sales team will confirm a time. You can also walk through the 3D tour online."
  },
  {
   "q": "I am working with a real estate agent. Is that okay?",
   "a": "Yes. Buyers working with an agent are welcome. Have your agent contact the sales team to set up a showing."
  }
 ],
